Religious-corp document-signing scope (per ADR-2605231230 §7):

  - Document templates and the runtime are restricted to non-profit
    religious-corp internal use. Commercial resale or third-party SaaS
    repackaging is a §2(b) violation.
  - No advertising or promotional templates may be bundled with this
    actor (Charter Rider §2(c)).
  - Permissible purpose tags are limited to: `council-resolution`,
    `land-donation`, `membership-affirmation`, `force-rd-consent`,
    `public-fund-disbursement`, `internal-agreement`, `general`.
